'''Combat''' is the first ever [[fighting style]] that the player gets when they first join the game.

It is the simplest fighting style in the game, letting the user throw punches and small dashes/impacts.

It is recommended to buy another fighting style such as [[Dark Step]], [[Electric]], or [[Water Kung Fu]] quickly, as Combat is generally considered to be the worst fighting style for grinding and [[PvP mechanics|PvP]]. Compared to the available fighting style options in the [[First Sea]], Combat is generally extremely weak.

==Obtainment==
Combat is the first fighting style players receive when starting Blox Fruits. Once replaced with another fighting style, it can be relearned from the [[Remove Blox Fruit]] NPC in the [[First Sea]] at [[Prison]]. Accessing the learning prompt (''"Remove my fighting style"'') requires the player to have completed all [[island Secrets|island secrets]] in the [[First Sea]], visited all islands told by the secrets master after selecting "Tell me some stories." with the middle town teleporter, and have their Blox Fruit removed beforehand.
;Note<nowiki>:</nowiki>: The [[Remove Blox Fruit]] NPC will simply reply, ''"Not here, not now."'' if the player tries to relearn Combat from it in the [[Third Sea]] at [[Castle on the Sea]].

